Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:03.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀俄明州 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wyoming? What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.69,0:00:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,图上每一个叉都是一个废弃的边境教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of these x's is an abandoned frontier church …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是十九世纪中期\N{\fnArial\fs30}all mid-19th century,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,由萨穆埃尔·科尔特建造\N{\fnArial\fs30}built by Samuel Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔·科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Colt …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个能杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon-killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又会做枪的萨穆埃尔·科尔特吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- gunmaking Samuel Colt? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他建造了连接教堂的私人铁路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He built private railway lines connecting church to church.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,连起来恰好是这个图形\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just happens to lay out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个一百平方英里的恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A 100-square-mile devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,1973年\N{\fnArial\fs30}1973.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 看起来像怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - What does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是真的吗 - 非常真\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it real? - Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.17,0:00:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 怎么着 天使操纵了时间机器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, what, angels got their hands on some Deloreans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么到这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是流动的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is fluid, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不容易 但我们偶尔能扭曲时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy, but we can bend it on occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想你们该知道「炼狱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm thinking you know "Purgatory."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是为了打开一扇门让什么东西进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all about opening a door to let something in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.81,0:00:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么东西 - 我正在研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能给点提示吗 - 查到个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you give us something? - I got a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「万物之母」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mother of all."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:00:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道怎样猎杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got zero on ganking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多事要做 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so much to do. Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.51,0:01:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有话告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:11.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:19.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（怀俄明州 桑赖斯 1861年3月5日）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:23.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（48小时前）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里某个地方 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here, somewhere. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我搬开这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me move this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嘞个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到坎贝尔家族图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Campbell family library.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西都是萨穆埃尔收集的喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Samuel collected all this stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明显是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们要找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, what are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何能打跑万物之母的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anything that'll put a run in the octomom's stockings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,选一排吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个家伙有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either of you jokers ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过有关凤凰的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything about a phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞弗（美国影星） 华金（美国歌手） 还是巨大的火鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}River, Joaquin, or the giant flaming bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰的灰烬可以烧毁万物之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the ashes of a phoenix can burn the mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们上哪能弄到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Where do we get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.86,0:03:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问住我了 我还以为那是个神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me. I thought it was a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看咱能不能找到关于凤凰的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see if we can find something out about a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.51,0:04:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 伙计们 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys, guys, guys, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,1861年3月5日\N{\fnArial\fs30}"March 5, 1861.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑赖斯 怀俄明州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise, Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天枪杀了一只凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun killed a phoenix today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下了一堆阴燃的灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left a pile of smoldering ash."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的 谁的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Whose gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}CoIt's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔特 就是那个科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colt? Colt like …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.59,0:04:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自\N{\fnArial\fs30}From…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔·科尔特的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Samuel CoIt's… journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是他的吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's his? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老哥 不是吧 - 老弟 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude, no. - Dude, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 才不给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, let me see it. - Get your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于凤凰他还说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what else did he say about the phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它长什么样 有羽毛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it look like? Has it got feathers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面只写了「凤凰」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just says "Phoenix."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说了在哪找到的吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he say where he tracked it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我想咱得自己去找一只了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so I guess we got to find one of our own,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管它到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道在哪能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where we can find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,1861年3月5日\N{\fnArial\fs30}March 5, 1861.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑赖斯 怀俄明州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise, Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱穿越过去搞定他 就像「星际迷航四」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll "Star trek iv" this bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看过「深空九号」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only watched "Deep space nine."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像都不认识你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I don't even know you guys anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「星际迷航四」 拯救鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Star trek iv." Save the whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回到过去 去找萨穆埃尔·科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hop back in time, we join up with Samuel Colt,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕杀那只凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}we hunt the phoenix,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带着那些灰烬回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we haul the ashes back home with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间旅行吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time travel? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划靠谱么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a reasonable plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个家伙能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a guy who can swing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在世界命运悬于一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, fate of the world is in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 现身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, come on down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:05:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家小哥召唤你呢 赶紧下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I dream of Jeannie" your ass down here pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeannie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们需要一些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you need some assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们是想和老大谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, we kind of need to talk to the big kahuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是代表卡西迪奥来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here on Castiel's behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 忙着呢 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Busy? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一条关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've got a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的万物之母的线索 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the mother of freaking everything, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信你们的事情很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure your issue's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但卡西迪奥正在统率军队 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Castiel is currently commanding an army, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得跟他的秘书在这儿耗着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we get stuck with miss money penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们要有自知之明\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you need to learn your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不管你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know who you think you are …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 那你觉得我们不算吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think we're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们只是在需要的时候才召唤他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you call him when you need something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fighting a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显你们不知道 否则你们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly you don't, or you wouldn't call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次遇到点破事儿就召唤他\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time you stub your toe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些渺小的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you petty, entitled little pie…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我会搞定这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I'd take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要留下 - 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're staying? - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情办完我就回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come when I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她是 我的副官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. She's, uh, my lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 很尽责\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's… committed to the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,言归正传 你们有什么需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要置办补给 我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supply run, he said. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, about your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只有24个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll only have 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the answer to your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是用一系列偏微分方程式来解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}can best be expressed as a series of partial differential equations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 说简单点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, aim lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你们穿越的越远\N{\fnArial\fs30}The further back I send you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越难带你们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the harder it becomes to retrieve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时已经是极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}24 hours is all I can risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没有在此期限内带你们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't pull you home within that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就找不到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be lost to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好给你弄一块手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we better get you a watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄了一堆啥玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要入乡随俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going native.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,混入当地人中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, no, thanks. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 迪恩 我穿我这套就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Dean, I can … I can wear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看起来像个太空人么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look like a spaceman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 就因为你是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just because you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,西部牛仔控\N{\fnArial\fs30}obsessed with all that wild west stuff …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才没有 - 你超迷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not. - You have a fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 我只是喜欢老电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. I like old movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把克林特·伊斯特伍德的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can recite every Clint Eastwood movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有电影和台词都倒背如流\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever made, line for line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括那些猴子的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the monkey movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 尤其是那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Especially the monkey movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家叫克莱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Clyde.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码把衬衫穿上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least wear the damn shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这太二了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来太二了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩是要去参加土风舞会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going to a hoedown?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地的习俗是穿毯子么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, is it … is it customary to wear a blanket?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫墨西哥范儿斗篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a serape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes. It's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:08:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了不说了 咱们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方用信用卡可买不到东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you're goin', they don't take plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会送你们穿越到三月四日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send you back to March 4th.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该够时间让你们去找科尔特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should give you time to find the colt…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及这个什么凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and this phoenix creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 明天中午见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, see ya at high noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（桑赖斯 怀俄明州）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 要的就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是还要把他们带回来么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about getting the boys back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时之内向我祈祷 我就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray for me in 24 hours, and I'll return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为我们所有人祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pray for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们去找萨穆埃尔·科尔特吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's go find Samuel Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 咱应该先去酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we should try the saloon first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能从当地人那探到什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, see what we get from the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你说了算 土风哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Whatever, sundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们有时间泡泡酒吧里的妞么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we'll have time to hit on saloon girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你踩到什么了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是马的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's horse …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authenticity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是1861年3月4日\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stand here today …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聚集在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}March 4th, 1861 …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,依法制裁伊莱亚斯·芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}to execute justice upon Elias Finch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因其谋杀了自己的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the murder of his own wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这才叫真实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Talk about authenticity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我泰·莫蒂默 现任怀俄明州巡审法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentence handed down by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,正式宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tye Mortimer, duly appointed judge of the Wyoming circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将被处以绞刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be hung by your neck until you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么要说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会遭到报应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna burn for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真欢乐哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说我们到哪去找萨穆埃尔·科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where do we find Sammy Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我知道该找谁打听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know who to ask, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,毯子不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟我们谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:11:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要看来者何人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends who's askin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊斯特伍德执法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal Eastwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特·伊斯特伍德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint Eastwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here is, uh, Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是德州骑警\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Texas Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位小哥 有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what can I do for you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're looking for a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,衬衣不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shirt, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的衬衣怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with my shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上非常干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,比看起来脏一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dirtier than it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找萨穆埃尔·科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find Samuel Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那位造枪高手 - 是的 他在镇子里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The gun maker? - Yeah. Is he in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去问问酒吧里的埃尔金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might try asking Elkins over at the saloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是这儿的元老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been here longer than god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,失了个望\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.39,0:13:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位喝点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'll you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好 喝点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, okay. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们这里最好的威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have your top-shelf whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only have the one shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他来点菝葜啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll have a sarsaparilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是埃尔金斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Elkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我没别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识萨穆埃尔·科尔特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know a man named Samuel Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年前 他曾经过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He passed through here about four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说 他正在二十英里外的驿站旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor is, he's building a railroad stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造一个火车车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 miles out of town, just by the postal road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟不拉屎的鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil's gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点符合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅哥们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉是我这里的头牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla's my best girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,和姐玩玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要姐的香吻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象中脏多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-so much more germier than I pictured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.37,0:14:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,法官大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好像有约吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥差一点就贞洁不保了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当法官的好处挺多嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's good to be judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:14:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝起来像汽油 我擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. It's like gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.41,0:15:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,菝葜啤酒还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarsaparilla ain't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 治安官 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, sheriff? - 'Course I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼会留下脚印吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless ghosts leave footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 刚刚那是伊莱亚斯·芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am telling you, Elias Finch was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了法官之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did…that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出了那扇大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he walked out that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,绞刑没有绞死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rope didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前也有过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他可能会在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got any idea where he could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在很多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a thousand places.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有办法引蛇出洞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got a way to flush him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们会组一队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course. We're gonna form a posse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把芬奇吊起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're gonna string Finch up right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给他头上来一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a bullet in his head for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That actually sounds like a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也应该一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two should come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮后 楼下见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet downstairs at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 不见不散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩先弄身像样的行头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourselves some real gear first, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 我们应该留心一下芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we ought to pay our respects to Finch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我想的一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰涅槃 焚烧猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose from the ashes, burned up its victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的 有可能不是什么火鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe we're not looking for a flaming bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许凤凰是人的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the phoenix is actually walking around in cowboy boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点道理 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes sense, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能就是芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be Finch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 我们怎么解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, question is, how do we put this thing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we do know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一样东西可以杀死一切生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll kill friggin' anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, The Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你去找枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you go get the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据萨穆埃尔·科尔特的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}But isn't the gun coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪应该出现在这里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, according to Samuel CoIt's journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这里的人好像都不认识科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but people here barely even know who Colt is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你去找到他 然后创造历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you got to go find him and make history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.63,0:17:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下来 和那队人一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay here, hook up with the posse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you know me …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是治安队磁体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a posse magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我喜欢《治安维持队》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I love posse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能印在T恤上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that into a t-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有完没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 科尔特在镇外二十英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the problem is, coIt's 20 miles outside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找他 怎么可能在中午前回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to get there and back before noon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛仔 骑马吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ride 'em, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从另一边上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh… uh, try … try the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好孩子 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, good boy. - Right. Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This actually feels all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 放轻松 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take it … just take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you bet. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 上午十一点吧 - 别迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, 11:00 a.M., right? - Don't be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的马儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That poor horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.82,0:19:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,自作孽不可活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟法官说去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell it to the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把我召唤过来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You summoned me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 我最近听说了一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, I've been hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些我不愿相信的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things I don't want to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我那是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If what's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.15,0:19:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的邪恶小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dirty little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.03,0:19:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须打败拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to defeat Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的方式不对 卡西迪奥 - 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not this way, Castiel. - Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把希望寄托在你的身上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We put our faith in you, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你却变成了这副模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…look what you're turning into.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别怪我不客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.30,0:20:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么飞机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.37,0:21:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在应战还是撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we running or fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.75,0:22:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,新帽子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}New hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥就是帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安队呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the posse?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.64,0:22:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是我来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be early.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说只有你一个新手蠢到这种程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're the only greenhorn dumb enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然想去捉鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go chasing after a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官可是硬汉 他会过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff's tough as nails. He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 治安官死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god! The sheriff's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,前言撤回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今谁来当治安官呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the sheriff now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.17,0:22:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What. What…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你荣升治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是萨穆埃尔·科尔特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 找错醉鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the wrong drunk, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.09,0:23:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝您有美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔特 我们一直在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking for you, Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.11,0:23:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」是指谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who might "we" be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.61,0:23:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久之前就退出江湖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've long since hung it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这把老骨头累了 力不从心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired, and I'm too damn old for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.86,0:23:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且毫无疑问的是我不想自找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sure as hell not looking for any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.10,0:23:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但麻烦还是找上门来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's found you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.09,0:23:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔特 我们知道是你建造了那扇恶魔之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you built that devil's gate, Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要亲手为我们开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna open it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 要想活命 你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, if you fancy keeping your lungs in your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.44,0:23:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们更想把你撕成碎片 你这个软…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we'd rather rip you to ribbons, you soft…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}A damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.78,0:24:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.77,0:24:20.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,蒙戈的糖果快递哟（《神枪小子》中的台词）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candygram for mongo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.72,0:24:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,香客 您好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, pilgrim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.61,0:24:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是香客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't no pilgrim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.31,0:24:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 往后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.12,0:24:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that any way to, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,问候你的新长官的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}greet your new boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.93,0:24:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今早没去参加治安队啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed you at the posse this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为你 我只能孤军奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a one-man wolf pack, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.10,0:24:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.75,0:24:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去探望我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going to visit my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.36,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让她先等等吧 - 但如果我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, she'll have to wait. - But if I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.30,0:25:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇说他回来是为了向前任治安官…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finch said he was coming back for the former sheriff…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…莫蒂默法官…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Judge Mortimer…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和你索命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人已死 一人苟活\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two down and one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.49,0:25:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就放我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.70,0:25:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当真以为你能逃出他的魔爪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think you can outrun him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.59,0:25:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把你杀掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.41,0:25:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.45,0:25:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们先搞定他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we gank him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.82,0:25:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,「搞定」 什么叫「搞定」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gank"? What's "gank"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.70,0:25:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你一定是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister, you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.91,0:25:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不干 你自己去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.23,0:25:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是叫你与他同归于尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to throw down with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.09,0:25:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是要求你扮演好你的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you to play your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.96,0:25:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的角色 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My part? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.08,0:25:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.98,0:25:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.93,0:26:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是恶魔 我不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, not a demon! Not a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…只是个猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…just a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.91,0:26:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.86,0:26:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是萨穆埃尔·科尔特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Samuel Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.52,0:26:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.73,0:26:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我是来自2011年的一名猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm a hunter from the year 2011.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.50,0:26:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.62,0:26:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.84,0:26:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这就相信我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…uh, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.11,0:26:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你入行时间像我一样久的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you've done this job as long as I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…即使是遇到拿着魔砖的未来巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a giant from the future with some magic brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.52,0:26:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以微微一笑 绝对不抽\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't exactly give you the vapors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.83,0:26:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我杀死一只凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help killing a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.59,0:27:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰真的存在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A phoenix? They exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.50,0:27:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,三小时之后 你将亲手射杀一只凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you shoot one in about three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.51,0:27:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.74,0:27:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.09,0:27:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.78,0:27:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.01,0:27:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是太糊涂就是太清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm either too drunk or not drunk enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.11,0:27:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我具体要做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it I'm about to exactly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.81,0:27:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰现在在桑赖斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the phoenix is in Sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.49,0:27:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在出发的话 可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, if we leave now, you can…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.94,0:27:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的处境我十分理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate your situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.09,0:27:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not gonna be of any help to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.69,0:27:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm booked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.93,0:27:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你明明在这里写着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but… but you say right here…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.29,0:27:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,白纸黑字也不见得是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe everything that you read.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.22,0:27:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.92,0:27:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.19,0:27:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 猎魔人不退休 - 我退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no such thing. - I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎魔根本没有退出这么一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 在我的时代你可是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth, in my time, you're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.06,0:27:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.57,0:27:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我们必须杀死这只凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, we… we need to kill this phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.29,0:27:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的灰烬是杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its ashes are the only thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.70,0:27:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要对付的怪物的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can kill the monster I'm hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.88,0:28:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就先把这烂摊子收收好 然后跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stow your crap for a few hours, and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.25,0:28:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须马上出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.44,0:28:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么跟我走一趟 要么把枪借我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, either you're coming with me, or I need the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.38,0:28:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.82,0:28:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.45,0:28:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.15,0:28:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩牌输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost it in a game of stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.10,0:28:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.40,0:28:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.54,0:28:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像是说谎的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that doesn't sound like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.16,0:28:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到一小时前 你打死了两个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot a couple of demons with it less than an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.67,0:28:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.83,0:28:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,两对靴子印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two pairs of bootprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.28,0:28:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋里有硫磺味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cabin reeks of sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想要这枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.89,0:28:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一个诅咒 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a curse. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.00,0:28:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 让我卸掉你的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Then let me take it off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.90,0:28:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是多历练历练 再回来跟我说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go put on a few more miles and come back, and we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.15,0:28:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我经过的试炼数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I've got plenty of mileage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.36,0:28:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,信我的话 我是在帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing you a favor. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.66,0:29:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.42,0:29:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能坐视不管吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can really just sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.81,0:29:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一生都耗在了猎魔上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given my whole life to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.18,0:29:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.98,0:29:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎样你都无所谓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it doesn't matter what happens now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.03,0:29:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你所做的一切 都是无意义的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So everything you did, it all means nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.43,0:29:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.15,0:29:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 怎么弄得像大战变形金刚回来一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you… you like you went 12 rounds with truckasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.06,0:29:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.18,0:29:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.82,0:29:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭到了背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.85,0:29:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.64,0:29:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.12,0:29:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斐尔腐化了她 她跑来对付我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He corrupted her. She turned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.10,0:29:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那姑娘… 蛮正的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl was a real… peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.77,0:29:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's… dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.45,0:29:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受了伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… was wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.08,0:29:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要安全的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed… safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.11,0:29:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.63,0:30:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙上那手指画做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the finger painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.00,0:30:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是避开天使监视的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a warding symbol against angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤得重吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad's it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.00,0:30:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.51,0:30:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.55,0:30:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在距离把那两个小子从神奇西部拉回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we got less than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.62,0:30:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩不到一小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you pick up the kids at frontierland.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.82,0:30:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.49,0:30:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.85,0:30:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,打斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.34,0:30:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,耗尽了我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}drained me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.65,0:30:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're up on blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.06,0:30:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤别的小翅膀来也是一样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}then call in another halo who can get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.08,0:30:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有个能给你充电的办法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's got to be something that can juice you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.22,0:30:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语啦什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spell… something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.32,0:30:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一种方法或许行得通 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one thing that might work, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.13,0:30:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,极其危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.14,0:30:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.75,0:30:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, lay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.85,0:30:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.60,0:30:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.23,0:30:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,用灵魂做交易 以吻封缄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make another deal? Seal it with a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.95,0:31:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让我触碰你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to let me touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.00,0:31:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,触碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.76,0:31:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的灵魂是非常纯粹的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human soul… it's pure… energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.55,0:31:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能从中吸取一些能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can siphon some of that off,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.94,0:31:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许就可以把萨姆和迪恩接回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I might be able to bring Sam and Dean back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.34,0:31:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那问题在于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the catch is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.88,0:31:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种做法的危险性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing this is like…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.26,0:31:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无异于将手伸进核反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting your hand in a nuclear reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.36,0:31:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要十二万分小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do it very gingerly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.73,0:31:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you'll explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.98,0:31:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.35,0:31:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你稳当些别出差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep both hands on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.80,0:31:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.87,0:31:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆你这死小子一辈子都没迟到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never been late in your damn life, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.40,0:31:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会子倒磨蹭起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you're dragging ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.19,0:31:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的妙计呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is your big plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.54,0:31:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇不来就让我烂在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me rot in here till Finch comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.09,0:31:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.69,0:31:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来 他为什么要杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's he gunning for you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.52,0:31:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你是没看见我们绞死他那幕咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you missed the part where we hung him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.65,0:32:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得对芬奇这样的存在来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm thinking to a thing like Finch,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.27,0:32:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都不叫事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's no big whoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.21,0:32:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本该一走了之 却又特地回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would've just blown town, but he came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.11,0:32:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒像为报私仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seems personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.83,0:32:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.45,0:32:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我出去 我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me out of here, and we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.95,0:32:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.12,0:32:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那牢门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up that cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.49,0:32:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.97,0:32:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都能把人脸融掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You melt people's faces off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.50,0:32:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄坏这么个小门想必是小菜一碟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you got the juice to tear that apart easy, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.35,0:32:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫非你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.35,0:32:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是他们吊起你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you couldn't break those cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.79,0:32:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法打开那手铐一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they strung you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.49,0:32:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁铐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron shackles…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.54,0:32:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁条子 铁钉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Iron bars, iron nail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.12,0:32:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看出来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See a pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.74,0:32:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别愁了 我遇到的大多数生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Most creatures I meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.84,0:32:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都禁不住铁器\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't get it up for iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.79,0:33:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物的公共弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a common monster problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.56,0:33:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.84,0:33:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slash sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.53,0:33:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这混蛋做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this son of a bitch did?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.07,0:33:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.91,0:33:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我娶了一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was married to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.44,0:33:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个好女人 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good woman … human.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.90,0:33:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住在城外 不生是非\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lived outside of town, didn't bother anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 有颗善良之心的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, freak with a heart of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢叫我怪物 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to call me "Monster, " Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.31,0:33:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们那天只是进城\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all we did was go into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.73,0:33:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在银行只呆了五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go into the bank for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.16,0:33:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我出来时 她不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come out, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.39,0:33:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我听到了她的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I heard her scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.48,0:33:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她抓到小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had her pinned in the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.75,0:33:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去阻止他 他掏出枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go to stop him, he pulls his gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我射击 然后是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoots me, then her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.45,0:33:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死在了我的怀中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.07,0:34:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我死不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course, I don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.30,0:34:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪声引来治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shots brought the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 我就被关入了铁牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing I know, i'm in iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.00,0:34:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我要他在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I want him just where he is …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.49,0:34:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,被困 害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}trapped, scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.07,0:34:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把好戏留到了最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved the best for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.43,0:34:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.46,0:34:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.07,0:34:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的准备以生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really willing to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.10,0:34:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来保护这个渣滓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect this piece of filth?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.10,0:34:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我一点不关心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I could care less about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.10,0:34:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个软弱的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a dick and a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.66,0:34:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不关他的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this ain't about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.05,0:34:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.22,0:34:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.59,0:34:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.24,0:34:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我必须杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… I got to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.45,0:34:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you know what I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.49,0:34:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就知道你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you know you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.29,0:34:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟 我怎么没考虑到这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, I should've seen that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.65,0:35:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.80,0:35:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.01,0:35:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where's colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.17,0:35:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来不了了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not coming. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.48,0:35:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他送来这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he sent this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.06,0:35:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.49,0:35:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.56,0:35:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.33,0:35:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.55,0:35:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不能让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can't just.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些傻瓜陷在那穿不回来 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}strand those idjits in deadwood, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.03,0:35:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可风险…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risks…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我爆炸就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…Don't explode me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.23,0:36:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出来 芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out here, finch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.33,0:36:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.83,0:36:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 咱单挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.98,0:36:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 这就是你选择的死法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is how you want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.32,0:36:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.77,0:37:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼哼哈嘿 王八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yippee-ki-yay, mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.37,0:37:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.77,0:38:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得送我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to send us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.41,0:38:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 看看他 他累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look at him. He's fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.91,0:38:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never want to do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.00,0:38:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.73,0:38:30.06,Title,0,0,0,0,,我还活着呢 安妮·奥克利（《狂野西部》中的神枪手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still kickin', annie oakley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.12,0:38:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,最起码要恢复个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be back good as new in…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.15,0:38:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,十到二十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}a decade or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.20,0:38:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we screwed the pooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.57,0:38:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.96,0:38:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个叫萨姆·温彻斯特的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a sam winchester here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.83,0:38:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.22,0:38:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is nuts …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.41,0:38:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和几个人打了赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and a couple guys made a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.83,0:39:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西躺在办公室有\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…This thing's been laying around the office since…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.93,0:39:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,年头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.94,0:39:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,上边有张纸条写这要今天送到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, with a note on it saying to bring it here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.43,0:39:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨穆埃尔·科尔特送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from a-a samuel colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.56,0:39:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, that's … that's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.95,0:39:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.53,0:39:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.67,0:39:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的萨姆 我在你这个装置上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Sam, I got this address and date.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.53,0:39:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了这地址和日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Off your thingamajig,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.08,0:40:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信附上的东西可能会有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And I thought the enclosed might come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.66,0:40:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔·科尔特 敬上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regards, samuel colt."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.07,0:40:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我想的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.13,0:40:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰的灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashes of a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.42,0:40:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.15,0:40:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经受的灵魂汤煮不是毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I didn't get a "Soulonoscopy" For nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.18,0:40:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.95,0:40:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我们要和她开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…It means we take the fight to her.
